### Phase 3: Home Screen Integration

**Objective**: Add profile dropdown to ConfigScreen, wire up selection logic, populate fields on selection.

**Deliverables**:
- DropdownMenu widget in ConfigScreen
- Profile-to-fields population logic
- Last-used profile persistence
- Visual feedback for selected profile

**Dependencies**: Phase 1 and Phase 2 complete (ProfileRepository and ProfilesScreen exist)

**Risks**:

| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|------------|--------|------------|
| DropdownMenu list rebuild causes focus loss | Medium | High | Cache dropdownMenuEntries in state variable (Discovery S2-06) |
| Dropdown selection overwrites user edits | Medium | Medium | Set _hasUserEdits = true on selection (Discovery 11) |
| Material 3 keyboard behavior | Low | Low | Use requestFocusOnTap: false (Discovery 09) |

### Tasks (Lightweight Approach)

| #   | Status | Task | CS | Success Criteria | Log | Notes |
|-----|--------|------|----|------------------|-----|-------|
