| 3.2 | [ ] | Load profiles from repository and populate dropdown entries | 2 | Dropdown shows all profiles with format "CALLSIGN (HEX)" | - | Call repository.getForDropdown() (alphabetical + last-used pinning) |
| 3.3 | [ ] | Implement onChanged handler to populate hex/callsign fields | 2 | Selecting profile fills TextField controllers immediately | - | Use _hexController.text = profile.hex |
| 3.4 | [ ] | Set _hasUserEdits = true on dropdown selection | 1 | Selecting profile prevents next poll from overwriting fields | - | Discovery 11 mitigation |
| 3.5 | [ ] | Cache dropdownMenuEntries in state variable | 2 | List only rebuilds when profiles change (not every build()) | - | Discovery S2-06 mitigation |
| 3.6 | [ ] | Configure requestFocusOnTap: false | 1 | Tapping dropdown does not trigger keyboard on mobile | - | Discovery 09 |
| 3.7 | [ ] | Listen to repository.changes stream and refresh dropdown | 2 | Adding profile in Planes screen immediately updates ConfigScreen dropdown | - | Discovery 06 cross-screen sync |
| 3.8 | [ ] | Write widget test: selecting profile populates fields | 2 | Test selects profile from dropdown, verifies hex/callsign fields updated | - | Lightweight coverage |

