### Phase 4: Device Sync Logic

**Objective**: Implement auto-selection on app launch/resume, auto-creation of new profiles, local override on save, and polling coordination.

**Deliverables**:
- Lifecycle observer for app resume
- Auto-selection logic matching device hex to profiles
- Auto-creation of profiles from device data
- Progressive enhancement with fallback for offline device
- Polling coordination (lock during save/selection)

**Dependencies**: Phase 1, 2, 3 complete (full UI + storage stack exists)

**Risks**:

| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|------------|--------|------------|
| Device offline at launch | High | High | Progressive enhancement: load last-used, attempt sync in background with timeout (Discovery 03) |
| Auto-creation creates invalid profile | Medium | Medium | Validate callsign before auto-creation; fallback to "UNKNOWN" with warning toast (Discovery S3-02) |
| Sync timing conflicts with user edits | Medium | High | Implement lifecycle observer; respect _hasUserEdits flag; show prompt for conflicts (Discovery 02) |

### Tasks (Lightweight Approach)

| #   | Status | Task | CS | Success Criteria | Log | Notes |
|-----|--------|------|----|------------------|-----|-------|
| 4.1 | [ ] | Add WidgetsBindingObserver mixin to ConfigScreenState | 1 | didChangeAppLifecycleState method called on app resume | - | Discovery 02 implementation |
| 4.2 | [ ] | Implement _autoSelectProfileFromDevice method | 3 | On app resume: fetch device config, match hex to profile, select in dropdown | - | Core auto-selection logic |
| 4.3 | [ ] | Add progressive enhancement for offline device | 3 | On launch: load last-used profile immediately, attempt device sync with 10s timeout in background | - | Discovery 03 mitigation |
| 4.4 | [ ] | Implement auto-creation logic for new hex | 3 | If device hex not in profiles: validate callsign, save new profile, show toast, auto-select | - | Discovery S3-02 with validation |
| 4.5 | [ ] | Modify _pollDevice to skip when _isSaving or _isSelectingProfile | 2 | Polling paused during save operations and dropdown selection | - | Discovery 11 race condition fix |
| 4.6 | [ ] | Persist last-used hex to SharedPreferences on dropdown selection | 2 | Last selected profile ID stored, used as fallback on next launch | - | Progressive enhancement support |
| 4.7 | [ ] | Show prompt when device hex differs from manual selection | 2 | On late device connection: show "Device detected with [callsign]. Switch?" dialog | - | Discovery 03 recommendation |
| 4.8 | [ ] | Write integration test: auto-selection on app resume | 2 | Test simulates app resume, verifies correct profile auto-selected | - | Use real repository + mock SkyEchoClient |
| 4.9 | [ ] | Write integration test: auto-creation of new profile | 2 | Test device with unknown hex, verifies profile created and selected | - | Lightweight coverage |

**Test Examples**

```dart
// test/integration/device_sync_test.dart
import 'package:flutter/material.dart';
import 'package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart';
import 'package:shared_preferences/shared_preferences.dart';
import 'package:tactical_radar/models/aircraft_profile.dart';
import 'package:tactical_radar/services/profile_repository.dart';
import 'package:tactical_radar/screens/config_screen.dart';
import 'package:skyecho/skyecho.dart';

void main() {
  late ProfileRepository repository;

  setUp(() async {
    SharedPreferences.setMockInitialValues({});
    repository = ProfileRepository();
    await repository.init();
  });

  testWidgets('given_device_with_known_hex_when_app_resumes_then_profile_auto_selected', (tester) async {
    /*
    Test Doc:
    - Why: Validate auto-selection on app lifecycle events (AC #5)
    - Contract: On app resume, device hex matched to profile, dropdown auto-selected
    - Usage Notes: Lifecycle observer calls _autoSelectProfileFromDevice on resume
    - Quality Contribution: Ensures device-is-source-of-truth behavior; catches sync bugs
    - Worked Example: Device hex='7CC599' matches profile → dropdown selects "VH-ABC (7CC599)"
    */

    // Arrange - Pre-save profile
    await repository.save(AircraftProfile(
      id: '1',
      hex: '7CC599',
      callsign: 'VH-ABC',
      createdAt: DateTime.now(),
      updatedAt: DateTime.now(),
    ));

    // Mock SkyEchoClient to return known hex
    final mockClient = MockSkyEchoClient();
    when(mockClient.fetchSetupConfig()).thenAnswer((_) async => SetupConfig(
      icaoAddress: '7CC599',
      callsign: 'VH-ABC',
      // ... other fields
    ));

    await tester.pumpWidget(MaterialApp(
      home: ConfigScreen(client: mockClient),
    ));
    await tester.pumpAndSettle();

    // Act - Simulate app resume
    final binding = tester.binding;
    binding.handleAppLifecycleStateChanged(AppLifecycleState.resumed);
    await tester.pumpAndSettle();

    // Assert - Dropdown should auto-select profile
    expect(find.text('VH-ABC (7CC599)'), findsOneWidget);
    // Verify fields populated
    expect(find.byKey(Key('hex_field')), findsOneWidget);
    final hexField = tester.widget(find.byKey(Key('hex_field'))) as TextField;
    expect(hexField.controller?.text, '7CC599');
  });

  testWidgets('given_device_with_unknown_hex_when_fetched_then_profile_auto_created', (tester) async {
    /*
    Test Doc:
    - Why: Validate auto-creation from device data (AC #5 - new hex handling)
    - Contract: Device hex not in profiles → new profile created, saved, and auto-selected
    - Usage Notes: Auto-creation shows toast notification; validates callsign before saving
    - Quality Contribution: Ensures seamless onboarding; documents auto-creation flow
    - Worked Example: Device hex='NEW123' → profile created with callsign from device → toast shown
    */

    // Arrange - Repository starts empty
    final mockClient = MockSkyEchoClient();
    when(mockClient.fetchSetupConfig()).thenAnswer((_) async => SetupConfig(
      icaoAddress: 'NEW123',
      callsign: 'VH-NEW',
      // ... other fields
    ));

    await tester.pumpWidget(MaterialApp(
      home: ConfigScreen(client: mockClient),
    ));
    await tester.pumpAndSettle();

    // Act - Simulate app resume (triggers device fetch)
    final binding = tester.binding;
    binding.handleAppLifecycleStateChanged(AppLifecycleState.resumed);
    await tester.pumpAndSettle();

    // Assert - Profile created and auto-selected
    final profiles = await repository.getAll();
    expect(profiles, hasLength(1));
    expect(profiles.first.hex, 'NEW123');
    expect(profiles.first.callsign, 'VH-NEW');

    // Verify toast notification shown
    expect(find.byType(SnackBar), findsOneWidget);
    expect(find.textContaining('Added VH-NEW'), findsOneWidget);
  });
}
```

### Non-Happy-Path Coverage
- [x] Device offline at launch (test 4.3 - progressive enhancement)
- [x] Unknown hex auto-creation (test 4.9)
- [ ] Invalid callsign from device (fallback to "UNKNOWN" with warning)
- [ ] Device fetch timeout (10s timeout enforced, show warning)

