## Complexity Tracking

Track component-level complexity using CS 1-5 scale:

| Component | CS | Label | Breakdown (S,I,D,N,F,T) | Justification | Mitigation |
|-----------|-----|-------|------------------------|---------------|------------|
| ProfileRepository | 2 | Small | S=1,I=1,D=1,N=0,F=0,T=1 | Single file service with SharedPreferences; straightforward CRUD | Unit tests with real storage; in-memory factory for speed |
| ProfilesScreen | 2 | Small | S=1,I=1,D=0,N=0,F=0,T=1 | Standard Flutter ListView + dialog forms; follows existing patterns | Widget tests for list rendering |
| ConfigScreen Integration | 3 | Medium | S=2,I=1,D=0,N=1,F=0,T=1 | Modifies existing polling logic; dropdown integration; cross-screen sync | Phased approach; polling lock discovery addressed |
| Device Sync Logic | 3 | Medium | S=2,I=1,D=1,N=1,F=0,T=1 | Auto-selection on lifecycle events; auto-creation; offline handling | Progressive enhancement; integration tests; fallback to last-used |

**Total Plan Complexity**: CS-3 (medium) - matches spec estimate (S=2, I=1, D=1, N=1, F=0, T=1 = 6 points)

**Mitigation Summary**:
- CS-3 components: Phased delivery (4 phases for sync logic), progressive enhancement pattern, comprehensive integration tests
- No CS ≥ 4 components: No feature flags or staged rollout required

